# ==========================================
# ✉️ PORTFOLIO CONTACT FORM CONFIGURATION
# ==========================================
# Copy this file to '.env.local' and set ONE of the following integrations.
# If none are set, the form runs in secure 'Development Fallback Mode' logging submissions to terminal.

# ------------------------------------------
# OPTION A: Resend (Recommended for custom domains)
# ------------------------------------------
# 1. Sign up for a free account at https://resend.com
# 2. Add and verify your custom domain.
# 3. Create an API Key and paste it below.
# 4. Set the destination email address (CONTACT_EMAIL_TO).
#
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_123456789abcde
# CONTACT_EMAIL_TO=mahaveerk.dev@gmail.com

# ------------------------------------------
# OPTION B: Web3Forms (Easiest free setup, no domain verification required)
# ------------------------------------------
# 1. Enter your email at https://web3forms.com to get a free Access Key.
# 2. Paste the Access Key below.
#
# WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
